OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 76, seriously hurt after
OL,4,Abeing hit by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 76-year-old woman suffered
OL,7,Flife-threatening injuries when she was
OL,8,Fhit by a car in East Yorkshire.
OL,10,FThe incident, involving the pedestrian
OL,11,Fand a blue Ford Fiesta, happened on
OL,12,FHedon Road in Paull, East Yorkshire, at
OL,13,Fabout 15:30 BST on Sunday, Humberside
OL,14,FPolice said.
OL,16,FThe woman was taken to hospital for
OL,17,Ftreatment to her injuries and inquiries
OL,18,Fwere ongoing to establish the
OL,19,Fcircumstances, a force spokesperson
OL,20,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
