OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 76, seriously hurt after
OL,4,Abeing hit by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnyone who witnessed the incident, has
OL,7,Fdashcam footage or was in the area at
OL,8,Fthe time is urged to contact police on
OL,9,Fthe non-emergency 101 number.
